        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CSA12HD, 12\" Solid Brass Casement Stay Adjuster For French Doors </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith heavy duty construction, this 12 Inch Door Stay Adjuster is designed for French doors and large windows. Includes sex bolts for thru-bolt mounting (bolts go through the door or window casement). Totally adjustable, a tightening knob holds the window in place anywhere on the arm, so it will never wear out and loose friction. This 12 Inch Window Casement Stay Adjuster is made of heavy duty solid brass construction for lasting quality. It is available in 8 high quality finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-CSA12HD-Specifications.gif?v=1704354688\" width=\"600\" height=\"238\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana CSA12HD Window Casement Stay Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana CSA12HD Heavy Duty 12\" Casement Stay:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Rod Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Rod Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Sash Plate: 2-1/4\" x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Sill Plate: 1-3/4\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws and sex bolts.</li>\r\n<li>Designed specifically for French doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CSA12HD.pdf?v=1691095315\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  CSA12HD Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
